	"notice": "Connect the main USB port to a computer or tablet host. Configure pad actions and sensitivity in the compatible SoftStep editor; choose Hosted or Standalone mode to match the preset. DIN MIDI requires a KMI MIDI Expander. This is SoftStep 2 hardware, not SoftStep3: no direct TRS MIDI or CV outputs are claimed. Foot operation may offer an alternative to hand controls; suitability depends on the player and positioning. All assignments are preset-dependent. Select the profile manually if the host does not identify it: no unverified port aliases are supplied. Diagrams are original simplified schematics, not scale drawings. Physical controls without a binding are informational; use MIDI learn for configurable assignments.",
